abstract: >-
  Participant-disjoint EEG analysis of motor execution versus motor imagery on
  PhysioNet EEGMMIDB, quantifying sensorimotor and protocol-state contributions
  under fixed run ordering.
keywords:
  - EEG
  - motor imagery
  - motor execution
